BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group
UID:event_315781155@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260730T031224Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260810T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260810T220000
SUMMARY:Game Night @ Archetype West Asheville
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\n\\*\\*This is a collaboration 
 with the Asheville's Bored Game Geeks\\*\\*\n\nBring your favorite game(s)
  or learn a new one – members are always happy to teach! See you there a
 nd have a blast!\n**Welcome to the Game Night Extravaganza!**\n\nCalling a
 ll dice-rollers\, card-shufflers\, and strategy-curious adventurers!\nAre 
 weeknights feeling a tad mundane? Fear not! We’ve got the antidote: **Bo
 ard Games\, Brews\, and Bliss**.\n\n**Our Mission:** To ignite laughter\, 
 forge alliances\, and maybe—just maybe—unleash a few friendly rivalrie
 s & battle to the death!\nNo PhD in rulebooks required! Whether you’re a
  Settlers of Catan enthusiast or a Code Names solving ninja\, or your firs
 t time touching a board game ***we will explain all the rules needed.***\n
 \nExpect:\n\n* **Beer on Tap**: Because rolling dice is better with a pint
  in hand.\n* **Low Brainpower Required**: We’re all about fun\, not Ferm
 at’s Last Theorem.\n* **Epic Showdowns**: Ticket to Ride routes\, Splend
 or gem heists\, and High stakes Camel Up.\n\nFeel free to request any game
  you’d like to play or bring your own. So gather your guild\, stack your
  resource cards\, and let the games begin! May your laughter be loud\, you
 r moves be bold\, and your victory dances be legendary.\n\nSee you at the 
 table!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /315781155/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260721T225119Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260721T225119Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group
UID:event_315737300@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260730T031224Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260814T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260814T223000
SUMMARY:Learn to Swing Dance + 2 Hours of Social Dancing
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\nLet's go to Asheville Swing Ni
 ght on August 14th for an evening of swing dancing\, great music\, and a f
 un beginner-friendly lesson. 💃🕺\n\nThe instructors (Deb and Franklin
 ) will kick things off at 7PM with the beginner fundamentals so everyone c
 an learn the basic footwork and get comfortable with swing dancing. 🎶\n
 \nNo partner needed. During both the lesson and social dance\, most people
  rotate partners\, making it a fun way to meet people and get comfortable 
 in the space.\n\n(Most people come alone\, by the way.)\n\n**What dance ar
 e we learning?**\nIntro Lindy Hop and East Coast Swing.\n\n**How many peop
 le come?**\nThroughout the night there are 50–70 people who usually atte
 nd. The lesson and dance is open to the public\, not just this Meetup grou
 p.\n\n**What should I wear?**\nWear shoes that are comfortable to dance in
 . Heels are not recommended. Leather-soled shoes or comfortable sneakers a
 re best. Dressing up is optional — people wear everything from casual to
  vintage-inspired outfits.\n\n**Who's hosting this Meetup?**\nSara and Jer
 ed are your hosts for this meetup\, they're also two of the organizers of 
 the dance. Sara will be working the front door from 6:45 til 7 as you arri
 ve. Jered will be stationed inside the dance hall - walk through the door 
 and turn right\, we'll have a spot in the corner so everyone can meet each
  other before we disperse for the lesson and dance.\n\n**Does the Meetup g
 roup sit together all evening?**\nOnce the lesson starts\, the Meetup grou
 p disperses to take the lesson with everyone else. The lesson is immediate
 ly followed by a social dance. In our experience\, some of the Meetup atte
 ndees continue to sit together\, chat\, and listen to the music. Others (i
 ncluding the hosts) will be gone dancing and mingling around the room.\n\n
 **Logistics**\n📍 Location: Haw Creek Commons\nParking is onsite\, or at
  Haw Creek Elementary if the parking lot is full. Just walk across the fie
 ld to the venue.\n\n🕖 7PM sharp — Beginner swing dance lesson\n(Pleas
 e arrive on time\, as the lesson builds progressively and is harder to joi
 n late if you're brand new.)\n\n💃🕺 8-10:30PM — Social dance with D
 J\n\n💵 $10 admission includes both the lesson and dance\nPay at the doo
 r (cash or Venmo)\n\n🚪 Doors open at 6:45 PM\n\n👥 Ages 12+\n\n**More
  Info:**\nFacebook Event:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/206515081075418
 8\n\nWebsite: [https://ashevilleswingnight.com/](https://ashevilleswingnig
 ht.com/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /315737300/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260718T164535Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260718T164535Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
